
* TrickFire Final 50 MHz Prototype Circuit
* Idealized AC fundamental model
* Probe: two 2.5mm diameter rods, 15mm spacing
* Exposed electrode length: 50mm

.param Csoil=20p
.param Rsoil=1k
.param Llead=40n

* Approximate fundamental of a 3.3V CMOS clock
VCLK CLK 0 AC 1.485

* Drive harmonic-reduction network
RDRV1 CLK DRV1 100
CDRV1 DRV1 0 33p
RDRV2 DRV1 DRV2 100
CDRV2 DRV2 0 33p

* Block DC from the soil electrodes
CEXC DRV2 A 1n

* Sense resistor
RSENSE A B 100

* Soil probe lumped approximation
LLEAD B TIP {Llead}
RLOSS TIP 0 {Rsoil}
CSOIL TIP 0 {Csoil}

* Reference divider
RREF_TOP A REF_TAP 499
RREF_BOT REF_TAP 0 49.9

* Reference low-pass phase network
CREF_COUP REF_TAP REF_SRC 1n
RREF_LP REF_SRC REF_IN 330
CREF_LP REF_IN 0 10p

* Probe divider
RPROBE_TOP B PROBE_TAP 499
RPROBE_BOT PROBE_TAP 0 49.9

* Probe high-pass phase network
CPROBE_COUP PROBE_TAP PROBE_SRC 1n
CPROBE_HP PROBE_SRC PROBE_IN 10p
RPROBE_HP PROBE_IN 0 330

* Approximate AD8302 input loads
RREF_INPUT REF_IN 0 3k
CREF_INPUT REF_IN 0 2p
RPROBE_INPUT PROBE_IN 0 3k
CPROBE_INPUT PROBE_IN 0 2p
RPROBE_BLEED PROBE_SRC 0 1Meg
* Probe parameter sweeps
.step param Csoil list 3p 5p 10p 20p 40p 60p
.step param Rsoil list 100 1k 10k
.step param Llead list 10n 20n 40n 60n 80n

* Narrow operating-frequency sweep
.ac lin 201 45Meg 55Meg

* Actual detector input ratio
.meas AC ratio50 FIND V(PROBE_IN)/V(REF_IN) AT=50Meg

* Absolute input signal levels
.meas AC ref50 FIND V(REF_IN) AT=50Meg
.meas AC probe50 FIND V(PROBE_IN) AT=50Meg

.end
